#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_glitch_analysis.ipynb:120004
#: d8d88e1f46d24281bfcfb02e2d092e7e
msgid ""
"The `rayleigh_test` measures how non-Gaussian the time-frequency energy "
"distribution is.  A p-value below 0.01 in a quiet background suggests the "
"data segment contains a significant non-Gaussian transient."
msgstr ""

